1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,157
The trial run entered its next phase on a Tuesday, with a package of four forms and a program on a computer that only one person could operate.

2
00:00:09,157 --> 00:00:14,526
“The importance of a clause is not theoretical,” Aisha said.

3
00:00:14,526 --> 00:00:25,084
“It is the difference between a percentage and a person.” Currently the club could not say what percent of its data was actually needed.

4
00:00:25,084 --> 00:00:29,018
The pattern was easy to attach to the wrong thing.

5
00:00:29,018 --> 00:00:44,455
A bold heading, a horizontal line, and a segment of the catalog were underlined for emphasis; the uncertainty was in the oven of the whole operation, where a shortage of clarity could bake a bad decision.

6
00:00:44,455 --> 00:00:47,884
“Omit the flavor,” Maya wrote.

7
00:00:47,884 --> 00:00:51,523
“Maximize the precision.”

8
00:00:51,523 --> 00:00:56,527
The diversity of the volunteers was the only inclusion that mattered.

9
00:00:56,527 --> 00:01:13,429
A bulky fixture on the wall, a stationary bicycle in the corner, and a wrapped package of aluminium foil: the lab had a density of objects and a shortage of space, and the wrapping alone took an hour to remove.

10
00:01:13,429 --> 00:01:20,947
The theoretical part of the trial was a liberation from the old assumption that more data means more safety.

11
00:01:20,947 --> 00:01:28,055
“Astronomy can measure a millimetre of movement at the other end of the sky,” the engineer said.

12
00:01:28,055 --> 00:01:40,103
“We cannot measure a decision in our own office.” The stoppage of the launch was, in that sense, a form of mechanization in reverse.

13
00:01:40,103 --> 00:01:51,136
The dynamics of the next month were simple: one action a week, one review of the system, and one honest talk about what was off and what was on.

14
00:01:51,136 --> 00:01:57,050
“Look at the movement of the data, not the bank balance,” she said.

15
00:01:57,050 --> 00:02:13,966
“We are not able to earn consent; we can only four times a year show that we did not lose it.” The side of the argument that carried the day was the smallest one: furnish the reader with clarity, and the technology will follow.

16
00:02:13,966 --> 00:02:23,484
The height of the shelf, the aluminum foil, and the revision of the catalog had to be assembled into one document before the audit.

17
00:02:23,484 --> 00:02:30,372
“You cannot integrate a body of evidence by holding it in your hand,” the engineer said.

18
00:02:30,372 --> 00:02:39,491
A revision a week, a body of notes, and a hold on the launch: that was the whole plan.
